(6,'2224b123-5bcb-454c-baec-cb996c38c7cb','database','default','{\"uuid\":\"2224b123-5bcb-454c-baec-cb996c38c7cb\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Mail\\\\NewsletterMail\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"Illuminate\\\\Mail\\\\SendQueuedMailable\",\"command\":\"O:34:\\\"Illuminate\\\\Mail\\\\SendQueuedMailable\\\":15:{s:8:\\\"mailable\\\";O:23:\\\"App\\\\Mail\\\\NewsletterMail\\\":7:{s:6:\\\"\\u0000*\\u0000log\\\";O:45:\\\"Illuminate\\\\Contracts\\\\Database\\\\ModelIdentifier\\\":5:{s:5:\\\"class\\\";s:18:\\\"App\\\\Models\\\\MailLog\\\";s:2:\\\"id\\\";i:34;s:9:\\\"relations\\\";a:1:{i:0;s:9:\\\"recipient\\\";}s:10:\\\"connection\\\";s:5:\\\"mysql\\\";s:15:\\\"collectionClass\\\";N;}s:14:\\\"\\u0000*\\u0000subjectLine\\\";s:70:\\\"An investment offer from the revolutionary blockchain platform DAO DES\\\";s:7:\\\"\\u0000*\\u0000body\\\";s:5915:\\\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\r\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\r\\n<head>\\r\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\r\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\r\\n    <title>DAO DES Invitation<\\/title>\\r\\n<\\/head>\\r\\n<body style=\\\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#0b0c18;color:#f0f0f0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<table align=\\\"center\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"max-width:800px;margin:auto;background-color:#111320;border:1px solid gold;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"padding:40px;\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<h1 style=\\\"color:gold;text-align:center;font-size:28px;margin-top:0;\\\">DAO DES — Decentralized EcoSystems<\\/h1>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    Dear <strong style=\\\"color:#40e0d0;\\\">{{name}}<\\/strong>,\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    My name is <strong>Valery Akimov<\\/strong>. I represent the <strong>DAO DES (Decentralized EcoSystems)<\\/strong> project.  \\r\\n    We are pleased to present to you our innovative platform that addresses the key issues of modern crypto projects —  \\r\\n    centralization, limited scalability, and insufficient functionality of dApps.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    The DAO DES project bridges the real world and blockchain technologies,  \\r\\n    enabling the inflow of funds from the Web2 world into the Web3 ecosystem.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">1. Project Description<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#ccc;\\\">\\r\\n    <li><strong>Upgraded DPoS consensus<\\/strong> with enhanced security, decentralization, and scalability through sharding — creating one of the fastest and safest Web3 platforms.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>Intuitive applications:<\\/strong> a hybrid messenger integrated with Telegram for decentralized communication and data storage.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>Wallets:<\\/strong> user-friendly, similar to banking apps, but with built-in DeFi and blockchain features.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>Hybrid stablecoins:<\\/strong> simplicity and security for everyday crypto use.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">2. Market and Opportunities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    Internal analysis shows:<br>\\r\\n    • SOM (Achievable): $455 billion<br>\\r\\n    • SAM (Available): $1.4 trillion<br>\\r\\n    • TAM (Total): $2.42 trillion<br>\\r\\n    • PAM (Projected): up to $28 trillion\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    The crypto market continues to grow, and investors are focusing on fundamental decentralized projects. DAO DES offers advanced decentralization and long-term reliability.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">3. Financial Forecast<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    • Pessimistic scenario: $150 million \\/ year<br>\\r\\n    • Realistic scenario: $1.3 billion \\/ year<br>\\r\\n    • Optimistic scenario: over $6 billion \\/ year\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">4. Competition and Advantages<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#ccc;\\\">\\r\\n    <li>Lower fees and higher scalability than Ethereum.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Greater security and decentralization than Polygon.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>IBC module (Cosmos ecosystem) enables cross-platform interoperability.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>App creators receive 30% of transaction fees from their dApps.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">5. The DES Token<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#ccc;\\\">\\r\\n    <li>Stablecoin issuance<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Transaction fee distribution<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Delegation and staking<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Liquidity pool filling for $DES<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">6. Investment Volume<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    We are seeking <strong>$104 million<\\/strong> to scale the project and execute the roadmap,  \\r\\n    including marketing aimed at building a community of 1 million DAO DES users.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">7. Statement<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    We have reviewed your fund’s recent successes, and are confident DAO DES will be a perfect addition to your portfolio of successful investments.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2 style=\\\"color:gold;margin-top:30px;\\\">8. Conclusion<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    DAO DES was created for people — to systematically overcome the obstacles to adopting modern blockchain technologies.  \\r\\n    We blur the boundaries between Web2 and Web3, bringing innovation to a new level.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    We are on the verge of a revolutionary shift in the blockchain industry.  \\r\\n    Join us now to become part of a story that benefits both you and the entire Web3 world.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<hr style=\\\"border:1px solid gold;margin:30px 0;\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\\\">\\r\\n    With best wishes,<br>\\r\\n    <strong style=\\\"color:gold;\\\">Valeriy Akimov<\\/strong><br>\\r\\n    Chief Executive Officer (CEO)<br>\\r\\n    DAO Decentralized EcoSystems\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#aaa;\\\">\\r\\n    <strong>We are creating the future of Web3<\\/strong><br>\\r\\n    📱 +7 917 831 35 83 <br>\\r\\n  ✉️ <a href=\\\"mailto:AkimovV@daodes.space\\\" style=\\\"color:#40e0d0;\\\">AkimovV@daodes.space<\\/a><br>\\r\\n    🌐 <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/daodes.space\\\" style=\\\"color:#40e0d0;\\\">daodes.space<\\/a> <br>\\r\\n  💬 <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/t.me\\/akimov_vo\\\" style=\\\"color:#40e0d0;\\\">Telegram<\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:#777;line-height:1.6;margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #333;padding-top:15px;\\\">\\r\\n    <strong>Confidentiality Notice:<\\/strong> This email and any attachments are confidential and may be privileged.  \\r\\n    If you are not the intended recipient, please delete it and notify us immediately.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- {{tracker}} -->\\r\\n<img src=\\\"{{ $trackingUrl }}\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"display:none;\\\" \\/>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/body>\\r\\n<\\/html>\\\";s:16:\\\"\\u0000*\\u0000recipientName\\\";s:12:\\\"Сергей\\\";s:17:\\\"\\u0000*\\u0000recipientEmail\\\";s:21:\\\"sergeniyrus@yandex.ru\\\";s:2:\\\"to\\\"